<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! engine.checkout.undoes ~ a tend generation, put back

`lares repo undo [gen]` restores the bytes the named generation (else the last) replaced and records the restore as a new generation. A path a hand changed after that generation wrote it refuses unless `--force`.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ last · named

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`last` params=`~ restore the last generation`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`named` params=`gen/3 ~ restore generation 3`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ gen · root · force

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`gen` params=`takes/generation seat/1 as/<gen> ~ the ledger generation to restore; absent, the last`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`root` params=`takes/dir ~ the checkout this door keeps; absent, the checkout the CLI lives in`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`force` params=`kind/switch ~ restore a path a hand changed after that generation wrote it`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ local

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`local` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ restores this host's files under the radius lock; this handler checks no ocap`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · familiar-home-only · root-no-directory · generation-not-whole · undo-refused

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`~ name one of read, tend, verify, undo`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`familiar-home-only` params=`~ --familiar names a home's familiar; lares home takes it`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`root-no-directory` params=`~ --root names no directory; name the checkout's top level`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`generation-not-whole` params=`cure/[[engine.checkout.undoes gen/3]] ~ a generation reads as a whole number`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`undo-refused` params=`~ the ledger holds no such generation, or the restore threw; the line names why`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ restored · foreign

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`restored` params=`exit/0 fields/[[radius generation undoes restored refused]] ~ the generation stands restored, recorded as a new one`>>
<<has entity=`band` name=`foreign` params=`exit/3 fields/[[radius generation undoes restored refused]] ~ a hand changed a path since; --force restores it`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ cli

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares repo undo

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host spells/[[lares repo undo]] ~ the terminal`>>
```

